{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50235","headline":"秋夜（伯三六一九。又三八八五） · 桓顒","name":"秋夜（伯三六一九。又三八八五）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"数夜独无欢，客心恒不安。\n近城闻鼓异（易），远寺[一]听钟难。\n月照窗边暖，风吹帘外寒。\n齐能罗帐里，独坐抱琴弹。\n（[一]原作「寺远」，依刘校互乙。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"桓顒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50235.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50235","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}